    <h1>Delete Your My PlanIt AI Account</h1>
    
    <div class="warning">
        <strong>⚠️ Important:</strong> Deleting your account is permanent and cannot be undone. All your data will be permanently removed.
    </div>

    <h2>How to Delete Your Account</h2>
    
    <div class="steps">
        <h3>Method 1: In-App Deletion (Recommended)</h3>
        <ol>
            <li>Open the My PlanIt AI app on your device</li>
            <li>Go to <strong>Settings</strong></li>
            <li>Scroll down and tap <strong>"Delete Account"</strong></li>
            <li>Confirm your decision by typing "DELETE" when prompted</li>
            <li>Your account and all data will be immediately deleted</li>
        </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="contact-info">
        <h3>Method 2: Email Request</h3>
        <p>If you cannot access the app, you can request account deletion by email:</p>
        <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:infinate4loops@gmail.com">your-email@example.com</a></p>
        <p><strong>Subject:</strong> Delete My PlanIt AI Account</p>
        <p><strong>Include in your email:</strong></p>
        <ul>
            <li>Your registered email address</li>
            <li>Confirmation that you want to permanently delete your account</li>
        </ul>
        <p><em>We will process email deletion requests within 30 days.</em></p>
    </div>

    <h2>What Data Gets Deleted</h2>
    
    <h3>✅ Data That Will Be Permanently Deleted:</h3>
    <ul>
        <li>Your account profile and login credentials</li>
        <li>All meal plans and recipes you've created</li>
        <li>All vacation and travel plans</li>
        <li>All to-do lists and tasks</li>
        <li>All weekend activity plans</li>
        <li>Any photos you've uploaded through the app</li>
        <li>All app preferences and settings</li>
        <li>Usage analytics tied to your account</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>📋 Data Retention:</h3>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>No data is retained</strong> after account deletion</li>
        <li>Anonymized usage statistics (not tied to your identity) may be kept for app improvement</li>
        <li>Legal compliance data may be retained as required by law</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Before You Delete</h2>
    <p>Consider these alternatives:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Export your data:</strong> Save your meal plans and travel plans before deletion</li>
        <li><strong>Take a break:</strong> You can simply uninstall the app without deleting your account</li>
        <li><strong>Contact support:</strong> If you're having issues, we might be able to help</li>
    </ul>

